    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0070_cassiopeia_09",
      "hash64": "54BDC4E74489DE26",
      "text": "Our final goal...is to defeat the mastermind that\\nfirst recruited the five squad bosses and created\\r\\nTeam Star. The one they call the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]big boss[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
