        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "team_0070_cassiopeia_13",
      "hash64": "54BACAE74487B281",
      "text": "But once all the squad bosses are out of action,\\nthe big boss’ll finally have to take the stage.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
